# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Qiskit Serverless to run quantum-classical workloads across the cloud and on quantum-centric supercomputers."
msgstr "Gunakan Qiskit Serverless untuk menjalankan beban kerja kuantum-klasik di cloud dan di superkomputer berbasis kuantum."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Pengenalan Qiskit Serverless"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Pengenalan Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless provides a simple interface to run workloads across quantum-classical resources. This includes deploying programs to the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform and running workloads remotely, as well as easy resource management for multi-cloud and quantum-centric supercomputing use cases.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless menyediakan antarmuka sederhana untuk menjalankan beban kerja di seluruh sumber daya kuantum-klasik. Ini mencakup penerapan program ke IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dan menjalankan beban kerja dari jarak jauh, serta manajemen sumber daya yang mudah untuk kasus penggunaan multi-cloud dan superkomputer berbasis kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium users can build, deploy, and run their workloads remotely on classical compute made available through IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna premium dapat membangun, menerapkan, dan menjalankan beban kerja mereka dari jarak jauh di komputasi klasik yang tersedia melalui IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang mendapatkan peningkatan, dan fiturnya berubah dengan cepat.** Selama fase pengembangan ini, temukan catatan rilis dan dokumentasi terbaru di halaman [GitHub Qiskit Serverless](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an experimental feature available only for IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ini adalah fitur eksperimental yang hanya tersedia untuk pengguna IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When should I use Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Kapan sebaiknya pakai Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless helps manage classical and quantum resources across the entire [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow. This includes some of the following examples:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless membantu mengelola sumber daya klasik dan kuantum di seluruh alur kerja [pola Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns). Ini mencakup beberapa contoh berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallelizing classical tasks, such as pre-processing and post-processing\n"
msgstr "Memparalelkan tugas klasik, seperti pra-pemrosesan dan pasca-pemrosesan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persisting long-running workloads in the cloud, even if your laptop is turned off\n"
msgstr "Mempertahankan beban kerja yang berjalan lama di cloud, bahkan jika laptop Anda dimatikan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying reusable programs\n"
msgstr "Menerapkan program yang dapat digunakan kembali\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Apa saja yang termasuk? {#what-is-included}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following compute resources are included by default in the Qiskit Serverless environment. Users can contact [support](/guides/support) to increase any of these.\n"
msgstr "Sumber daya komputasi berikut sudah termasuk secara default di lingkungan Qiskit Serverless. Pengguna dapat menghubungi [dukungan](/guides/support) untuk meningkatkan salah satu dari ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Normal node:** \n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Maximum of two active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr ""
"**Normal node:** \n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Maksimum dua pekerjaan aktif per pengguna dalam satu waktu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**GPU node** (used by the [Algorithmiq TEM](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) Qiskit Function):\n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Nvidia L40S GPU\n"
"- Maximum of four active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr ""
"**GPU node** (digunakan oleh Qiskit Function [Algorithmiq TEM](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)):\n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- GPU Nvidia L40S\n"
"- Maksimum empat pekerjaan aktif per pengguna dalam satu waktu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum Platform, install the following packages:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan Qiskit Serverless di IBM Quantum Platform, instal paket-paket berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit_ibm_catalog` provides the client-side tools to upload and run remote programs, while `qiskit_serverless` provides server-side tools to distribute compute and manage data. These packages require `python` 3.11+. For users and organizations who want to run Qiskit Serverless on custom infrastructure, follow the [Cloud infrastructure setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/) guide.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit_ibm_catalog` menyediakan alat sisi klien untuk mengunggah dan menjalankan program jarak jauh, sementara `qiskit_serverless` menyediakan alat sisi server untuk mendistribusikan komputasi dan mengelola data. Paket-paket ini memerlukan `python` 3.11+. Untuk pengguna dan organisasi yang ingin menjalankan Qiskit Serverless di infrastruktur kustom, ikuti panduan [Pengaturan infrastruktur cloud](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
#| "Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects IBM Quantum Compute Service workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Saat ini, tabel beban kerja IBM Quantum hanya mencerminkan beban kerja Qiskit Runtime. Gunakan `job.status()` untuk melihat status terkini beban kerja Qiskit Serverless Anda. Temukan contohnya di panduan [Jalankan beban kerja Qiskit Serverless pertamamu dari jarak jauh](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

